editpe
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Snug vendors a local fork of the `editpe` crate at `vendor/editpe`, patched in
via `[patch.crates-io]` in the workspace `Cargo.toml`. The fork exists to add
the `set_rcdata` and `get_rcdata` methods, which upstream `editpe` does not
provide; they are how the application payload is stored in and read back from a
Windows PE's `RT_RCDATA` resource.

