Other dependencies
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Snug's remaining dependencies are declared in the workspace `Cargo.toml` and are
fetched from crates.io under their own licences. Their licence texts are not
reproduced here; the versions actually shipped are pinned in `Cargo.lock`, and
each crate's licence is recorded in its own `Cargo.toml` in the crates.io
registry.

The crates are not published to crates.io — the workspace sets `publish =
false` — so the licence texts that travel with a *release* are the ones beside
this file.
